e":"2015-03-09T18:01:15-07:00","id":434953,"title":"","content":"I'd love the be a part of this, Mummy's my favorite game line. I wouldn't mind being either a player or storyteller, though I'm not experienced in play by post. Any other details you can share?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/410-ristigger","name":"RisTigger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar410_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T23:29:05-07:00","id":435363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RisTigger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/434177-looking-for-pbp-want-to-try-out-a-mummy-the-curse-game?p=434953#post434953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd love the be a part of this, Mummy's my favorite game line. I wouldn't mind being either a player or storyteller, though I'm not experienced in play by post. Any other details you can share?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for dropping by!<br /> <br /> I have the Mummy corebook; got it a few weeks after it came out. When I say I don't grok it, I mean that I have trouble seeing what exactly a Mummy PC would do in a game. Hunting down relics seems very...pedestrian, for lack of a better word. I have a feeling I'm not really getting the scope of the game.<br /> <br /> If you want to know something specific, just ask.<br /> <br /> I have done a lot of freeform pbp, but comparatively little 